WHO   — BNA · BRAND NEW ANIMAL — an entertainment sphere — an anime-world
WHAT  — A high-school girl wakes up one day able to turn into a tanuki — a beastman — and flees to Anima City, a haven where humanoid animals live apart from a world that fears them. Hunting the reason for her change, she's drawn into the city's tensions with a brooding wolf and a buried history. Trigger's vivid, fast take on coexistence and the line between human and animal.
